{"id":"vod_sn_38495","vodId":"38495","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"雪之少女","name_cn":"雪之少女","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a0796c531dbb86a007e30f6657db5f88.jpg"},"summary":"因为父母被调往了海外就职，不想跟着出去的相泽佑一（杉田智和 配音）寄宿到了阿姨水濑秋子和她女儿名雪家里。时隔七年，再次来到这个北国小镇的佑一本应有记忆点，可是真实的情况确是毫无记忆。在这个小镇，他邂逅了各色少女。有总是元气满满、迷糊的月宫亚由（堀江由衣 配音）；有擅长料理喜爱猫咪的名雪（国府田麻理子 配音）；有丧失掉记忆，总是对佑一纠缠不休的泽渡真琴（饭冢雅弓 配音）；还有佑一身体不好安静的学妹美坂栞（佐藤朱 配音）等。佑一和她们在北国小镇度过了欢乐的冬天，并且一点点拾回失去的记忆。而这失去的记忆里，有悲伤、悔恨、眼泪……经过时间的洗礼，伤痛在一点点愈合。冬天已走，春天不远。　　本片改编自Key社的同名游戏。2002年由东映动画制作成动画上映，这部由京都动画重制。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/55rpSfMa3p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0CgnJ59qC51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/zYkZYdv5G81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ceFdWsY7V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MMQhQKyVZK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iQqeaNTtyk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/s5bUkK6ys51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iVkQFH77J21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/8rQV9YTp1R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Yn8SF5UgAG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/beLECrrTRE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Xaytb4ZdYb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6ur6ubdZwc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/